{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/ergodic-theory/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-ergodic-theory","title":"为何遍历理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/ergodic-theory/foundations/why-ergodic-theory","wordCount":1289,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"measure-preserving","title":"保测变换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/ergodic-theory/foundations/measure-preserving","wordCount":1351,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"ergodicity-definition","title":"遍历性定义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/ergodic-theory/foundations/ergodicity-definition","wordCount":1255,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础\">基础</h1><p>要谈论「时间平均等于空间平均」，得先把这句话里的每个词都安放到严格的数学结构上：谁在演化、什么量保持不变、「不可分解」又是什么意思。这一章搭好整个 hub 的地基，三篇文档回答三个递进的问题。</p>\n<p>第一篇「为何遍历理论」从动机出发：玻尔兹曼为支撑统计力学提出「遍历假设」，希望单个分子的长时间轨迹能遍历整个能量面，从而用空间平均代替难算的时间平均。这个物理猜想在原始形式上被证伪，却催生了一门把它精确化、并远超物理的数学学科。这一篇只讲来龙去脉与全局图景，不展开任何定义。</p>\n<p>第二篇「保测变换」给出舞台与演员：概率空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(X,\\mathcal{B},\\mu)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0304em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 加上一个保持 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 不变的可测变换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，构成动力系统的四元组。这里详述保测的含义、四个贯穿全书的范例（圆周旋转、二倍映射、Bernoulli 移位、面包师变换），以及庞加莱回复定理——几乎每个点都会无穷次回到自己出发的邻域。保测与回复的概念由本篇主讲，后续篇章只引用。</p>\n<p>第三篇「遍历性定义」给出全 hub 最关键的概念：一个保测系统是遍历的，当且仅当它无法被分解成两个有正测度的不变部分。本篇给出不变集、不变函数等多种等价刻画，区分遍历与非遍历的例子，并引入唯一遍历性。理解了遍历性，才能读懂下一章两大遍历定理为何成立。</p>\n<p>这三篇是后续一切的前提。读完它们，你就握有进入<a href=\"../theorems/\">定理章</a>的钥匙。</p>\n"}